<h1>ModigMakeGettyArray_OBS_LEARN
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>valToGetty = ModigMakeGettyArray_OBS_LEARN</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function valToGetty = ModigMakeGettyArray_OBS_LEARN </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> valToGetty = ModigMakeGettyArray_OBS_LEARN

 Make a vector to send to Getty in OBS_LEARN project.
 Note that shares task number (24), Imperative giving AND dictator, this
 one is the &quot;pavlovian&quot; version (in terms of labels in getty).

 Right now only 40 to 59 are free
 
 rbm 11.10</pre></div>

<!-- crossreference -->
